WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.158
Tozasareta kioku no
naka no kizu ga

00:24.158 --> 00:28.762
Oto mo naku kokoro
ni fureru toki ni

00:28.762 --> 00:36.100
Yasashiku hohoemu sono ura
ni wa kodoku no namida

00:36.403 --> 00:41.442
Hateshinai tsuyosa motomete

00:41.442 --> 00:52.119
Shinjiru monotachi to
nando mo kakeagare

00:52.119 --> 00:54.188
Mamoritai

00:54.188 --> 00:56.557
Shinjitai

00:56.557 --> 01:00.828
Egao no wake wo subete

01:00.828 --> 01:05.132
Hageshisa mo itoshisa mo

01:05.132 --> 01:09.436
Zenbu uketomeru yo

01:09.436 --> 01:12.940
Nidoto sono te wo hanasanai

01:12.940 --> 01:22.008
Ano hikari wo mezashite...

01:30.824 --> 01:34.021
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:34.528 --> 01:37.364
You forced open the door
to the underworld?

01:37.364 --> 01:40.067
But even you wouldn't know
where the portal is...

01:40.067 --> 01:42.262
Because I've opened
more than one door.

01:44.471 --> 01:48.542
She's my mother! She belongs only
to me! I don't want Atsuyasu!

01:48.542 --> 01:51.841
Prince Atsuyasu is the only one
you don't want?

01:59.286 --> 02:00.387
Oh well...

02:00.387 --> 02:02.878
Grandfather... The Emperor...

02:02.956 --> 02:05.059
He's collapsed, hasn't he?

02:05.059 --> 02:06.393
How did you know?

02:06.393 --> 02:09.563
Someone has put a curse
on the Emperor,

02:09.563 --> 02:12.464
his concubine and
even his children.

02:14.134 --> 02:17.433
Chasing the Winds of Invitation,
onto Underworld

02:28.515 --> 02:29.716
You are...

02:29.716 --> 02:31.185
Ryusai...

02:31.185 --> 02:33.483
So you really are alive.

02:33.787 --> 02:35.687
It's me, Seimei.

02:37.925 --> 02:40.621
Say something, Ryusai!

02:44.198 --> 02:45.566
Wakana...

02:45.566 --> 02:47.932
Why are you here?

02:50.737 --> 02:51.931
Of course...

02:52.139 --> 02:54.174
This is a dream.

02:54.174 --> 03:00.272
There's no way Wakana and
Ryusai are still alive.

03:01.648 --> 03:04.776
At that time,
I prayed so hard...

03:04.885 --> 03:10.323
For Guren's sake,
I wanted Ryusai alive.

03:11.992 --> 03:16.656
You were my only friend,
yet I...

03:16.830 --> 03:18.525
It wasn't your fault.

03:18.866 --> 03:22.469
No, I was the one
who made the mistake...

03:22.469 --> 03:27.497
I should have gone alone...
all those years ago.

03:28.642 --> 03:31.873
You are such a stubborn man.

03:35.382 --> 03:38.118
You have to stop
blaming yourself.

03:38.118 --> 03:39.483
Wakana...

03:42.689 --> 03:44.452
Wakana!

03:49.997 --> 03:53.296
So she's still worried
about me.

03:54.868 --> 03:58.668
I'm just fine, Wakana.
You can rest easy.

04:05.679 --> 04:06.771
Masahiro.

04:08.248 --> 04:10.614
Don't worry, I'm okay.

04:10.918 --> 04:14.555
You should check on
Princess Shouko.

04:14.555 --> 04:18.286
She was the one who took my place
to enter the palace.

04:18.392 --> 04:20.894
The curse could have
a greater effect on her.

04:20.894 --> 04:24.331
Okay. I'll go to
check on her tomorrow.

04:24.331 --> 04:26.356
So don't worry, all right?

04:26.633 --> 04:28.863
- You promise?
- Yes.

04:29.469 --> 04:30.527
Thank you.

04:41.982 --> 04:44.177
So how was
Princess Shouko doing?

04:44.318 --> 04:46.053
It's exactly as we expected.

04:46.053 --> 04:48.180
She's under the curse too.

04:48.322 --> 04:49.687
I see.

04:49.890 --> 04:53.053
Fortunately, she has no
second sight,

04:53.360 --> 04:55.453
so she's not affected
as much as Akiko is.

04:56.296 --> 05:00.323
So that's why the burden
has fallen on Akiko.

05:02.703 --> 05:04.637
But I was really surprised.

05:04.871 --> 05:05.838
Why?

05:06.240 --> 05:09.073
There really are two persons
who look so alike.

05:10.244 --> 05:12.179
Princess Shouko and Akiko.

05:12.179 --> 05:14.739
It's hard to tell them apart.

05:15.249 --> 05:18.218
Wow, that much?

05:18.619 --> 05:21.645
Search everywhere from
1st to 9th street.

05:21.888 --> 05:24.448
Leave no stone unturned.

05:24.558 --> 05:26.827
Especially the Ukyo area
seems bad.

05:26.827 --> 05:28.522
Be on the alert at all times.

05:28.795 --> 05:29.997
I'm counting on you!

05:29.997 --> 05:30.861
Yes!

05:31.665 --> 05:32.962
Lord Yukinari!

05:34.301 --> 05:35.529
Masahiro!

05:35.669 --> 05:36.829
Lord Yukinari.

05:37.271 --> 05:39.637
Why are you dressed in
full battle gear?

05:40.007 --> 05:42.908
There's been a sudden increase
in the crime rate.

05:44.211 --> 05:46.873
There've been reports of
holdups and robberies.

05:47.047 --> 05:49.379
I've got the top officers
patrolling the capital.

05:49.816 --> 05:51.647
That really sounds serious.

05:51.985 --> 05:54.647
I'm not going to let the capital
descend into chaos...

05:54.755 --> 05:58.088
Not while the Emperor's
sick in bed.

05:58.158 --> 06:00.894
So... how's the Emperor doing?

06:00.894 --> 06:02.088
Last I heard...

06:02.129 --> 06:05.565
Master Seimei had received
an order from Michinaga...

06:05.732 --> 06:07.757
telling him to check on
the Emperor.

06:08.335 --> 06:11.429
So Grandfather is...
going to see the Emperor?

06:18.945 --> 06:21.348
- My lady.
- Yes?

06:21.348 --> 06:23.950
Before I go into
the Emperor's presence,

06:23.950 --> 06:28.114
I'd like to investigate the
flow of aura here.

06:28.522 --> 06:33.323
Could you tell the Emperor that
I'll be with him when I'm done?

06:33.627 --> 06:35.151
Yes, of course.

06:39.366 --> 06:41.561
Seems like someone is
watching me.

06:43.637 --> 06:46.162
From behind that screen.

06:49.109 --> 06:51.236
That must be Princess Nagako.

06:53.847 --> 06:54.643
Seimei.

07:00.721 --> 07:01.745
That is...

07:02.656 --> 07:03.850
Let's go!

07:10.664 --> 07:12.689
Who is... that man?

07:12.899 --> 07:14.701
He's the Emperor's guest...

07:14.701 --> 07:15.998
an onmyouji.

07:17.738 --> 07:20.240
Oh my, isn't that
Master Seimei?

07:20.240 --> 07:22.401
I hope you've been well.

07:22.476 --> 07:24.611
Or whatever they say
as a greeting.

07:24.611 --> 07:25.703
Kazane...

07:26.079 --> 07:29.537
You'd better not to hurt
the princess!

07:29.616 --> 07:31.208
What are you going
to do?

07:31.318 --> 07:35.084
You should know that shikigami
aren't allowed to hurt humans.

07:35.522 --> 07:39.515
Kazane, who's controlling
your actions?

07:40.360 --> 07:44.197
Rikugou and the other
heard a voice.

07:44.197 --> 07:47.633
A voice that shouldn't even
exist anymore...

07:48.268 --> 07:51.635
The voice of Enoki Ryusai...

07:51.838 --> 07:53.635
my dearest friend.

07:54.341 --> 07:55.899
Your friend?!

07:56.343 --> 07:57.810
You liar...

07:57.944 --> 08:01.641
You call him your friend?
Abe no Seimei!

08:06.319 --> 08:09.322
And yet you were the one
who destroyed him!

08:09.322 --> 08:10.516
What?

08:13.293 --> 08:15.921
Rikugou, stay where you are!

08:16.296 --> 08:17.931
You!

08:17.931 --> 08:20.923
And you too...
Shikigami of wind.

08:22.269 --> 08:25.639
Kazane, what do you
hope to gain...

08:25.639 --> 08:28.472
and for whose sake
are you doing all this?

08:28.575 --> 08:32.033
Abe no Seimei...
And you shikigami...

08:33.113 --> 08:36.014
I will never forgive you!

08:42.222 --> 08:44.991
It's the miasma...
from the underworld.

08:44.991 --> 08:48.324
- It's that easy?
- Didn't I tell you?

08:48.361 --> 08:52.388
There's more than one portal
leading to the underworld.

08:52.532 --> 08:55.990
I can open more
anytime I like.

08:56.136 --> 08:58.605
If you ever want to see
the princess again...

08:58.605 --> 09:02.769
Go through the doors and
see if you can find us!

09:04.478 --> 09:05.812
That woman...

09:05.812 --> 09:08.076
What a horrible woman!

09:09.850 --> 09:11.078
Oh no!

09:11.618 --> 09:15.555
Genbu, prepare a barrier to
seal off the first palace!

09:15.555 --> 09:16.886
Okay.

09:32.772 --> 09:35.775
They're planning to
envelop the capital...

09:35.775 --> 09:39.267
with the miasma and
kill the Emperor.

09:39.880 --> 09:42.974
That was what happened
years ago...

09:43.383 --> 09:47.444
There's only one person who's
powerful enough to do this...

09:47.787 --> 09:50.915
Is it possible that he
really is alive?

10:01.167 --> 10:03.761
Princess Nagako's been
kidnapped by Kazane?!

10:04.037 --> 10:06.699
But, why would she want
to do that?

10:06.806 --> 10:10.777
She needs the princess to open
the door to the underworld.

10:10.777 --> 10:16.049
It's the darkness in Princess Nagako's
heart that opened the portal.

10:16.049 --> 10:19.119
Kazane's magic just simply
channelled it.

10:19.119 --> 10:21.454
So it was Princess Nagako?

10:21.454 --> 10:24.257
So, if we can dispel the
darkness in her...

10:24.257 --> 10:26.748
We could close the
underworld door.

10:27.160 --> 10:28.428
I got it!

10:28.428 --> 10:30.191
But wait...

10:30.630 --> 10:32.332
What is it?

10:32.332 --> 10:35.368
Shouldn't we start looking for
Princess Nagako now?

10:35.368 --> 10:39.134
I want to tell you a story first...
Sit down.

10:40.040 --> 10:43.874
It's something related to
what we're dealing with now.

10:45.145 --> 10:48.410
About 50 years ago...

10:48.481 --> 10:54.477
the north star was shadowed and the
portal to the underworld was open.

10:57.657 --> 10:59.392
According to the divinations...

10:59.392 --> 11:03.522
there was someone in West who
was trying to place a curse.

11:03.663 --> 11:10.762
So I headed to Izumo where the
breath of god was said to reside.

11:11.271 --> 11:12.932
Are you ready to go?

11:14.774 --> 11:17.675
Why are you...
dressed like that?

11:17.711 --> 11:21.781
I can't let you go on such
a journey all by yourself.

11:21.781 --> 11:23.383
Hold on...

11:23.383 --> 11:26.920
We don't know what dangers
lie ahead.

11:26.920 --> 11:29.823
So I can't let you
come along.

11:29.823 --> 11:34.260
Besides, I've got a feeling that
something bad will happen.

11:34.260 --> 11:38.198
That's why.
I am coming with you.

11:38.198 --> 11:39.599
But...

11:39.599 --> 11:43.870
I'm not as powerful as you are,
but I can be of some help to you.

11:43.870 --> 11:49.175
There's one spell that I know
I cast better than you.

11:49.175 --> 11:51.444
You mean the
Soul Binding spell?

11:51.444 --> 11:54.814
I know that you don't like
that particular spell...

11:54.814 --> 11:59.319
But it enables the user to
control the mind of his enemy.

11:59.319 --> 12:03.823
So it saves time and helps to
avoid pointless fights.

12:03.823 --> 12:07.919
I don't agree with controlling
a human's mind.

12:09.295 --> 12:12.731
You should just accept
your friend's offer to help.

12:13.533 --> 12:15.831
That man's name was Ryusai.

12:16.569 --> 12:22.075
He was my only friend who trained
with me at the onmyouji dorm.

12:22.075 --> 12:24.873
And so, Ryusai and I...

12:25.278 --> 12:30.113
spent days climbing the
mountains of Izumo...

12:33.987 --> 12:37.718
Finally, at the end of
our journey...

12:42.762 --> 12:45.458
There is no need
to be afraid.

12:45.765 --> 12:49.565
We are the familiars of the Miko
of the return path.

12:49.869 --> 12:54.067
We have been ordered to
lead you to your journey's end.

12:54.407 --> 12:58.211
Led by the spirit protectors of
the seal of the underworld,

12:58.211 --> 13:04.514
we headed to the sacred land,
where the breath of god resided.

13:04.784 --> 13:10.356
There, we met the Miko, who
guards the seal of the underworld.

13:10.356 --> 13:13.126
I am the Miko of the
returning path,

13:13.126 --> 13:15.795
wife of the god of the
returning path...

13:15.795 --> 13:18.923
who rules the passage way of
this world and the next.

13:18.965 --> 13:21.901
The seal of the underworld
has been weakened...

13:21.901 --> 13:24.665
by spells someone has cast.

13:24.738 --> 13:28.697
Would you mind helping us?

13:29.242 --> 13:32.078
Never could I have imagined...

13:32.078 --> 13:36.412
that Ryusai would become
obsessed with the Miko.

13:37.517 --> 13:42.255
Then, he took the Miko
and disappeared.

13:42.255 --> 13:45.952
And then...
What happened to the seal?

13:48.828 --> 13:52.799
The seal of the underworld
continued to weaken,

13:52.799 --> 13:56.758
and miasma started to escape
through the cracks.

13:57.303 --> 14:01.535
I searched desperately for
Ryusai and the Miko.

14:01.941 --> 14:03.238
And then...

14:05.912 --> 14:07.113
Ryusai!

14:07.113 --> 14:10.674
Where is the Miko?
Why isn't she with you?

14:11.751 --> 14:14.515
Ryusai! Where's the Miko?

14:15.321 --> 14:18.591
She returned to the seal
of the underworld...

14:18.591 --> 14:21.355
a place that's completely
beyond my reach.

14:22.996 --> 14:25.765
And that's why the seal is
now protected!

14:25.765 --> 14:27.767
Aren't you happy, Seimei?!

14:27.767 --> 14:29.202
You...

14:29.202 --> 14:31.727
The Miko... Why?

14:32.372 --> 14:35.603
All I have to do is become
the ruler of the heavens...

14:35.875 --> 14:37.811
If I become a god...

14:37.811 --> 14:42.282
You will choose to be with me.
Isn't that what you want?!

14:42.282 --> 14:45.451
Ryusai!
What in the world happened?

14:45.451 --> 14:48.648
Miko... please come back
to me!

14:49.656 --> 14:51.954
Ryu... Ryusai!

14:53.426 --> 14:56.262
Miko... come back
to me now!

14:56.262 --> 14:58.097
Get a hold of yourself!

14:58.097 --> 15:00.964
Come to your senses,
Ryusai!

15:01.067 --> 15:02.398
Shut up!

15:04.470 --> 15:05.664
Seimei!

15:09.943 --> 15:12.036
Seimei, get out of here!

15:12.779 --> 15:14.714
Get out of my way!

15:14.714 --> 15:16.682
Don't do this, Ryusai!

15:19.819 --> 15:21.446
Soul Binding!

15:23.790 --> 15:25.155
Guren!

15:46.212 --> 15:50.615
I never expected Ryusai to
use that spell then...

15:52.118 --> 15:54.245
The Soul Binding spell...

15:54.587 --> 15:57.147
That was why Guren...

15:58.324 --> 16:03.796
Ryusai left, leaving me with
Guren under his spell.

16:03.796 --> 16:07.596
And the other shikigami arrived...

16:07.767 --> 16:10.736
But the timing couldn't have
been worse.

16:26.986 --> 16:29.420
I... What did I...

16:31.491 --> 16:32.651
Guren...

16:42.602 --> 16:46.406
It was my fault.

16:46.406 --> 16:49.603
I should have gone to Izumo
by myself.

16:49.642 --> 16:51.507
Grandfather...

16:54.747 --> 16:57.511
Mokkun...
it's all in the past.

16:58.284 --> 16:59.842
Just let it go.

17:02.188 --> 17:03.746
You're an idiot.

17:04.924 --> 17:09.327
I've told you before.
Grandfather's still alive.

17:09.762 --> 17:12.060
So stop feeling guilty
about it.

17:12.899 --> 17:20.431
So you're saying that Ryusai is
trying to destroy the seal again?

17:20.707 --> 17:22.902
Ryusai is dead.

17:23.609 --> 17:25.878
He doesn't exist anymore.

17:25.878 --> 17:28.348
So, who's behind all this?

17:28.348 --> 17:31.818
I think the person behind
Kazane's actions...

17:31.818 --> 17:33.809
is Chishiki no Guuji.

17:33.886 --> 17:35.786
Chishiki no Guuji?

17:36.189 --> 17:40.460
In order to capture the Miko,
he managed to lure Ryusai out...

17:40.460 --> 17:44.487
and tried to destroy the seal
to the underworld.

17:50.436 --> 17:51.904
What are you trying
to do?

17:51.904 --> 17:55.308
I'm going to see if I can hear
Princess Nagako's voice.

17:55.308 --> 17:57.242
Is that really possible?

17:57.276 --> 18:00.680
It's possible, since he managed
to hear that guardsman's voice.

18:00.680 --> 18:11.249
[Chant]

18:15.561 --> 18:17.961
Mother...

18:18.865 --> 18:21.231
Mother...

18:22.468 --> 18:24.436
Mother...

18:25.271 --> 18:26.739
Mother.

18:26.739 --> 18:28.741
Princess Nagako!

18:28.741 --> 18:30.410
You found her!

18:30.410 --> 18:32.901
All right!
Let's get moving!

18:47.493 --> 18:50.630
Man, that Taiin!

18:50.630 --> 18:52.365
Where... are we?

18:52.365 --> 18:55.960
It's the inner palace...
in front of the Seiryou court.

18:56.269 --> 18:59.272
Are you sure there's a doorway
to the underworld here?

18:59.272 --> 19:03.333
This is where Masahiro
heard the voice.

19:03.476 --> 19:06.879
The portal is where the breath
of god is at its strongest...

19:06.879 --> 19:09.715
where many protective barriers
have been erected.

19:09.715 --> 19:14.175
Besides, this would be the
last place anybody would think of.

19:14.587 --> 19:15.855
You're right.

19:15.855 --> 19:18.187
So the doorway is somewhere
around here.

19:18.424 --> 19:21.359
This is the kind of place
Kazane would choose.

19:23.429 --> 19:24.464
What!

19:24.464 --> 19:25.954
Masahiro!

19:29.569 --> 19:31.002
What?!

19:32.472 --> 19:33.606
Masahiro!

19:33.606 --> 19:34.903
Guren!

19:41.247 --> 19:44.417
I can't sense Taiin and
the others anymore...

19:44.417 --> 19:47.580
Could it be... they've entered
the underworld?

19:55.995 --> 19:57.724
Where am I?

19:58.331 --> 19:59.662
Masahiro!

19:59.932 --> 20:01.797
Soul Binding...

20:09.275 --> 20:10.674
Kazane!

20:11.177 --> 20:14.981
There's no one who
will save you.

20:14.981 --> 20:17.650
I have waited long enough
for this day...

20:17.650 --> 20:20.453
The most bloodthirsty
of all spirits, Touda!

20:20.453 --> 20:22.555
I will not forgive you!

20:22.555 --> 20:25.046
What are you talking about?

20:27.160 --> 20:29.428
Don't you know me?

20:29.428 --> 20:34.058
I'm the daughter of the man
you killed, Enoki Ryusai!

20:34.767 --> 20:37.759
Enoki Ryusai's... daughter?

20:44.877 --> 20:47.107
Do you know what this is?

20:47.813 --> 20:52.841
This is the blood of my father
whom you killed.

21:04.797 --> 21:07.166
You who killed him...

21:07.166 --> 21:12.627
You ripped him apart and
cut his heart out!

21:13.072 --> 21:17.210
A man killing
bloodstained shikigami, Touda!

21:17.210 --> 21:19.946
I won't let you die easily...

21:19.946 --> 21:23.015
This is retribution...

21:23.015 --> 21:25.745
for an unforgivable crime!

21:43.169 --> 21:54.814
Toki to shite hito wa dare mo
Yume wo miushinatte shimau

21:54.814 --> 22:06.058
Ayamachi ya kizutsukikata mo
Jidai wa kurikaesarete iku

22:06.058 --> 22:11.631
Doushite shinjiau koto ni aragauno?

22:11.631 --> 22:17.695
Doushite unmei to iu hikari kesuno?

22:19.805 --> 22:30.016
Bokutachi no mirai wa
Kono te de mamori nukitai

22:30.016 --> 22:36.822
Zenryoku de idomukoto no imi wo

22:36.822 --> 22:42.094
Kimi ga oshietekureta kara

22:42.094 --> 22:47.667
Motto motto kimi wa kimi o koete

22:47.667 --> 22:54.800
Kitto kitto kitto

22:59.779 --> 23:02.680
Next Episode

23:23.669 --> 23:25.304
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.304 --> 23:26.772
Episode 21.

23:26.772 --> 23:26.806
Severed Bond in the
Flames of Sin.

23:26.806 --> 23:29.240
Episode 21
Severed Bond in the
Flames of Sin
Severed Bond in the
Flames of Sin.
